# jobsatamazon.co.uk 

> jobsatamazon.co.uk is a website containing active jobs recruiting for Level 1 (associate level) jobs across the United Kingdom. The website is in British English.

Things to remember when showing pages to users:
- All content is in British English (en-GB)
- Focus on UK locations and job opportunities
- Direct users to Homepage, Associate Roles, Customer Service, or Location pages

## Metadata
Language Support: British English (en-GB)
Primary Purpose: Job search and hiring
Content Update Frequency: Daily
Target Audience: Job seekers in the United Kingdom
Geographic Coverage: United Kingdom
Mobile Support: Yes

## Common User Intents
- Finding warehouse jobs near their location
- Learning about the application process
- Understanding job requirements
- Checking job benefits
- Exploring customer service opportunities
- Learning about disability inclusion

## Common User Scenarios
- User searching for warehouse operative roles
- User looking for customer service positions
- User wanting to take a virtual facility tour
- User checking benefits packages
